izde bir engel yoktur. İnkarcı kadınları nikahınızda tutmayın; onlara verdiğiniz mehri isteyin; inkarcı erkekler de hicret eden mümin kadınlara verdikleri mehirleri istesinler. Allah'ın hükmü budur; aranızda O hükmeder. Allah bilendir, Hakim'dir.","transliteration":"yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū idhā jāakumu l-mu'minātu muhājirātin fa-im'taḥinūhunna l-lahu aʿlamu biīmānihinna fa-in ʿalim'tumūhunna mu'minātin falā tarjiʿūhunna ilā l-kufāri lā hunna ḥillun lahum walā hum yaḥillūna lahunna waātūhum mā anfaqū walā junāḥa ʿalaykum an tankiḥūhunna idhā ātaytumūhunna ujūrahunna walā tum'sikū biʿiṣami l-kawāfiri wasalū mā anfaqtum walyasalū mā anfaqū dhālikum ḥuk'mu l-lahi yaḥkumu baynakum wal-lahu ʿalīmun ḥakīmun"},{"id":5161,"verse_key":"60:11","verse_number":11,"words":[{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَإِن","location":"60:11:1","transliteration":{"text":"wa-in"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"فَاتَكُمْ","location":"60:11:2","transliteration":{"text":"fātakum"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"شَىْءٌۭ","location":"60:11:3","transliteration":{"text":"shayon"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","location":"60:11:4","transliteration":{"text":"min"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"أَزْوَٰجِكُمْ","location":"60:11:5","transliteration":{"text":"azwājikum"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِلَى","location":"60:11:6","transliteration":{"text":"ilā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْكُفَّارِ","location":"60:11:7","transliteration":{"text":"l-kufāri"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"فَعَاقَبْتُمْ","location":"60:11:8","transliteration":{"text":"faʿāqabtum"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"فَـَٔاتُوا۟","location":"60:11:9","transliteration":{"text":"faātū"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","location":"60:11:10","transliteration":{"text":"alladhīna"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ذَهَبَتْ","location":"60:11:11","transliteration":{"text":"dhahabat"}},{"char_type_n